        "checksum": "2e2940a827afb17a879f6fbcfea3b576847dc3858a21f48de617e2690a7d46d6_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggv3crtgr-h_text": "Frequently Asked <span style=\"color:#3A5A40;\"><i>Questions</i></span>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_0": "<p>How is FusiForce different from other creatine gummies?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_1": "<p>Can women take FusiForce Creatine Gummies?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_2": "<p>How much creatine is in each serving of FusiForce?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_3": "<p>Is FusiForce third-party tested and verified for purity?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_4": "<p>Why pouches with individual serving bags?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_5": "<p>How long until I see results?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_6": "<p>Can I cancel my subscription anytime?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_7": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_8": "<p>Will FusiForce cause bloating or stomach issues?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_9": "<p>What is the best time to take FusiForce gummies?</p>",
        "ggq3keBygNw_childItem_10": "<p>Can I take FusiForce with protein powder or other supplements?</p>",
        "gglhMWzvXgh_text": "<p>Most creatine gummies on the market contain little to no actual creatine or use cheap, untested forms. FusiForce is third-party verified with full clinical dosing (5g per serving) and zero fillers. We test every batch so you know exactly what you're getting - real creatine that actually works. No hidden COAs, no \"email us for reports.\" The proof is here before you buy. Plus, we test AFTER cooking - not before - because creatine degrades with heat.</p>",
        "gghNwguXnDu_text": "<p>Yes. Creatine is highly effective for women. Many female users report better strength, endurance, and body composition without any masculinizing effects.</p>",
        "gg-GPgr7oko_text": "<p>Each serving (5 gummies) delivers a full <strong>5 grams of pure creatine monohydrate</strong> - the clinically effective dose used in studies for strength, power, and muscle growth.</p>",
        "ggd_m1qjlFK_text": "<p>Yes. Every batch is tested by ISO 17025 accredited labs for purity, potency, and label accuracy. We publish the results so you can see the proof yourself.</p>",
        "ggfV9SqzxeK_text": "<p>It took us 2 years to solve the melting problem. Each 3-gummy serving is pre-portioned and protected. Toss one in your gym bag without a container. No sticky mess.</p>",
        "ggdJBwNO2zB_text": "<p>Most users notice initial improvements within 2-3 weeks. 94% report improved energy by day 14. We recommend committing to at least 90 days for optimal results — which is why we offer a 90-day guarantee.</p>",
        "ggXhv7eNyBK_text": "<p>Yes! Cancel anytime via text in 10 seconds. Zero commitment. You can also pause, skip, or modify delivery dates through your account.</p>",
        "ggsDaH-NNbl_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the pouch is empty. That's how confident we are.</p>",
        "ggkd77RN1Gk_text": "<p>Unlike traditional creatine powder, FusiForce is formulated to minimize bloating. Most users report no stomach discomfort because the gummies use a high-quality, highly soluble form of creatine.</p>",
        "ggByPt_ss9U_text": "<p>Any time of day works, but most people prefer taking them with breakfast or post-workout for consistent daily levels. Consistency matters more than perfect timing.</p>",
        "ggaqwztj3uB_text": "<p>Yes. FusiForce mixes perfectly with protein shakes, pre-workouts, or any other supplement. There are no known negative interactions.</p>"
      }
    },
