        "ggsDkHJj1og_text": "<p><strong>Nate, 42, Las Vegas </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggTE8YxzQLS_text": "<p>\"My husband and I both take these now. We’re both stronger, recovering faster, and honestly having more fun in the gym together. We call them our 'happy couple candy' because we both feel younger and more alive. Best habit we started this year.\"</p>",
        "gggS_vvM4Nf_text": "<p><strong>Sophia, 38, Denver &nbsp;</strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggPuXUCUpXq_text": "<p>\"At 51 I thought creatine was for kids. These gummies proved me wrong. I’m moving weights I haven’t touched in years and recovering faster. My doctor asked what I’m doing different. I told him 'magic green apple candy'. He wrote it down.\"</p>",
