        "ggH4N-wQLqf_text": "<p>\"I hit a plateau after 12 years training. These gummies broke it hard. I’m adding weight every week and my workouts feel strong again. My gym buddy is pissed because I’m progressing faster than him. I just tell him to get on the gummies.\"</p>",
